1
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:01,880
Shit.

2
00:00:02,720 --> 00:00:03,640
Itti.

3
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:05,520
I found something in this footage.

4
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:07,200
That's one of Itti's men.

5
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:08,400
He's the one.

6
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:10,600
The person I think killed Anda.

7
00:00:10,720 --> 00:00:12,160
Bring your girlfriend to me,

8
00:00:13,120 --> 00:00:14,280
and your debt will be wiped out.

9
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:16,320
Almost everyone is here, I see.

10
00:00:16,360 --> 00:00:17,280
Who's missing?

11
00:00:17,320 --> 00:00:18,440
Oh.

12
00:00:18,920 --> 00:00:19,880
Jin, right?

13
00:00:20,120 --> 00:00:20,640
Jin.

14
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:21,760
Go help Podduang.

15
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:23,200
You're useless now.

16
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:27,920
Now, who's next?

17
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:44,880
Hey!

18
00:00:45,120 --> 00:00:46,280
Stop resisting.

19
00:00:46,720 --> 00:00:48,240
How could you do this, Itti?

20
00:00:48,720 --> 00:00:50,480
How are you involved in Anda's death?

21
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:54,000
You're Anda's brother, for God's sake.

22
00:00:54,040 --> 00:00:54,920
Exactly.

23
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:57,000
He was my own brother.

24
00:00:57,160 --> 00:00:58,840
Why did he have to meddle in this?

25
00:01:00,640 --> 00:01:01,880
What did Anda do?

26
00:01:04,120 --> 00:01:05,600
What did he do?

27
00:01:06,320 --> 00:01:07,640
If you want to know,

28
00:01:07,760 --> 00:01:09,880
why don't you ask
your new friend next to you?

29
00:01:13,080 --> 00:01:14,440
I told your brother everything

30
00:01:14,520 --> 00:01:16,240
so that he would be careful.

31
00:01:16,360 --> 00:01:18,000
I didn't tell him so you could kill him,

32
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:18,640
you bastard!

33
00:01:18,680 --> 00:01:19,520
Shut up.

34
00:01:19,960 --> 00:01:21,560
Do you want to follow
your boyfriend to the grave?

35
00:01:41,600 --> 00:01:44,000
[The depicted characters, behaviors, locations,
organizations, professions, and events]

36
00:01:44,039 --> 00:01:46,160
[are fictional and created
for entertainment purposes only.]

37
00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:48,360
[It is not intended to endorse or promote
any of the actions or behavior depicted.]

38
00:01:48,400 --> 00:01:49,680
[Viewer discretion is advised.]

39
00:02:02,560 --> 00:02:08,960
♫I used to wonder what we were,♫

40
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:14,920
♫I thought love needed something clearer,♫

41
00:02:15,720 --> 00:02:20,960
♫Took me time to learn what really matters♫

42
00:02:22,560 --> 00:02:27,640
♫Love has no rules, whatever comes after♫

43
00:02:29,040 --> 00:02:34,520
♫As long as I know what my heart wants to find,♫

44
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:37,360
♫As long as you're standing by my side,♫

45
00:02:37,400 --> 00:02:40,640
♫With you, the only one I'd choose every time,♫

46
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:44,520
♫I don't need a reason, as long as you're mine♫

47
00:02:45,120 --> 00:02:47,680
♫As long as you hold my hand,♫

48
00:02:48,160 --> 00:02:50,680
♫As long as next to me is where you stand,♫

49
00:02:50,680 --> 00:02:53,960
♫You're the one I'll always try to understand,♫

50
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:57,840
♫No matter how hard the road may be,♫

51
00:02:58,480 --> 00:03:01,160
♫Just hold my hand, and we'll be free♫

52
00:03:01,680 --> 00:03:04,480
♫As long as you're here with me♫

53
00:03:29,840 --> 00:03:31,040
Podduang, I'm sorry

54
00:03:31,320 --> 00:03:33,040
for bringing you into this mess.

55
00:03:33,320 --> 00:03:34,680
Don't blame yourself, Amp.

56
00:03:36,760 --> 00:03:39,840
It's Itti's fault
because he's the one who killed Anda.

57
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:41,320
You think you're so smart
for figuring that out now?

58
00:03:47,040 --> 00:03:48,400
What the hell do you want?

59
00:03:48,600 --> 00:03:49,760
Just say it!

60
00:03:50,600 --> 00:03:51,520
Do you want money?

61
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:55,720
Would someone like me

62
00:03:56,120 --> 00:03:58,200
ask a pathetic kid like you for money?

63
00:04:01,160 --> 00:04:02,080
It's this woman here...

64
00:04:02,920 --> 00:04:04,320
who has what I want.

65
00:04:05,280 --> 00:04:07,400
Everything you've got on me.

66
00:04:07,560 --> 00:04:09,560
- I want it all.
- I've already deleted it all!

67
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:11,600
I deleted everything
after I sent it to Anda.

68
00:04:11,640 --> 00:04:12,520
I don't believe you.

69
00:04:15,920 --> 00:04:19,160
What makes you think
I'd wanna keep your dirty little secrets?

70
00:04:19,480 --> 00:04:21,360
- I'm asking you nicely, Amp.
- She said she deleted it,

71
00:04:21,399 --> 00:04:22,520
so it's gone!

72
00:04:23,200 --> 00:04:24,000
Shut up.

73
00:04:24,760 --> 00:04:26,280
You think I'm joking?

74
00:04:27,080 --> 00:04:28,280
Do you see this gun?

75
00:04:29,320 --> 00:04:30,800
It's loaded with real bullets.

76
00:04:31,400 --> 00:04:33,080
And Anda's death

77
00:04:33,840 --> 00:04:35,360
really was my doing.

78
00:04:36,640 --> 00:04:37,600
How did you kill Anda?

79
00:04:37,640 --> 00:04:38,880
Why do you want to know?

80
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:41,320
Wanna die the same way he did?

81
00:04:43,200 --> 00:04:45,360
No, that's too much of a hassle.

82
00:04:46,120 --> 00:04:47,120
For someone like you...

83
00:04:47,640 --> 00:04:49,600
one shot is enough
to send you to heaven.

84
00:04:51,480 --> 00:04:53,200
Since you're going to kill me anyway,

85
00:04:53,200 --> 00:04:55,000
tell me how you killed Anda.

86
00:04:57,640 --> 00:04:58,520
Fine.

87
00:05:01,200 --> 00:05:02,400
If you want to know so badly,

88
00:05:03,800 --> 00:05:04,920
I'll tell you.

89
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:06,520
So you can die in peace.

90
00:05:18,880 --> 00:05:20,840
Let us go right now!

91
00:05:21,280 --> 00:05:23,360
- Let me go!
- Let me out!

92
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:25,240
Release us now!

93
00:05:30,960 --> 00:05:32,280
Where did you get these videos from?

94
00:05:32,480 --> 00:05:34,159
How could you do this, Itti?

95
00:05:34,240 --> 00:05:35,640
You're supposed to be a cop.

96
00:05:35,760 --> 00:05:37,440
This falls under human trafficking.

97
00:05:37,520 --> 00:05:39,480
Are you so greedy
that you have to resort to this?

98
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:41,159
I asked where you got these videos from!

99
00:05:42,360 --> 00:05:44,240
It doesn't matter where I got them from.

100
00:05:44,520 --> 00:05:46,880
What do you think
Dad would do if he found out?

101
00:05:47,080 --> 00:05:49,200
You'd better have some answers ready.

102
00:05:51,480 --> 00:05:53,200
Since he chose to meddle

103
00:05:53,360 --> 00:05:55,120
and stand in my way,

104
00:05:56,040 --> 00:05:57,600
I had to deal with him.

105
00:05:59,400 --> 00:06:01,080
Every car key

106
00:06:01,400 --> 00:06:03,040
can be reprogrammed.

107
00:06:03,760 --> 00:06:06,560
It can even be operated remotely.

108
00:06:11,640 --> 00:06:13,040
How could you have the nerve to do that?

109
00:06:14,840 --> 00:06:17,240
You wanted to get rich quick
using such evil methods?

110
00:06:18,400 --> 00:06:19,200
Yeah.

111
00:06:20,880 --> 00:06:22,480
Help!

112
00:06:23,200 --> 00:06:25,160
- Let me go!
- Quiet!

113
00:06:26,680 --> 00:06:27,920
Let me go!

114
00:06:28,280 --> 00:06:30,000
- Let me go!
- Let me out!

115
00:06:31,080 --> 00:06:32,240
What's gotten into you?

116
00:06:33,960 --> 00:06:36,280
Suddenly developed a conscience?

117
00:06:36,800 --> 00:06:38,560
I'm so disappointed in you.

118
00:06:38,880 --> 00:06:41,159
You shouldn't have expected anything
from me in the first place.

119
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:42,400
And what about Dad?

120
00:06:42,800 --> 00:06:43,840
And Mom, too?

121
00:06:45,040 --> 00:06:46,840
How do you think they'd feel?

122
00:06:47,800 --> 00:06:50,200
This isn't the kind of person
Dad raised you to be.

123
00:06:50,280 --> 00:06:52,520
This is all your fault.

124
00:06:53,480 --> 00:06:54,480
You did this.

125
00:06:54,760 --> 00:06:57,720
You're the one who turned me into this.

126
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:00,960
Doesn't Dad love you more than me?

127
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:02,200
Love? Don't make me laugh.

128
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:04,760
He just projected everything
he wanted onto me

129
00:07:04,760 --> 00:07:06,600
because you refused to
do anything he wanted!

130
00:07:07,880 --> 00:07:09,240
You've never been through what I have.

131
00:07:09,840 --> 00:07:10,760
You wouldn't understand.

132
00:07:10,960 --> 00:07:12,200
Someone like you

133
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:14,400
gets to be whatever they want.

134
00:07:15,080 --> 00:07:16,880
Even when you fell in love with a man,

135
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:18,840
Dad and Mom were only angry, at most.

136
00:07:19,040 --> 00:07:21,000
But they couldn't stop you.

137
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:22,640
Then why didn't you just tell him?

138
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:25,120
If you weren't okay with it,
you should've just told them.

139
00:07:31,680 --> 00:07:33,240
You think I haven't tried?

140
00:07:35,600 --> 00:07:38,520
You and I are not the same, Anda.

141
00:07:40,920 --> 00:07:42,960
No matter how hard I try to do good...

142
00:07:45,400 --> 00:07:47,880
all Dad cares about
is whether I follow his orders.

143
00:08:03,760 --> 00:08:04,920
Hello, Kum.

144
00:08:05,640 --> 00:08:06,800
It's nothing.

145
00:08:07,720 --> 00:08:09,120
I'm just having dinner with Itti.

146
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:17,840
Anda was already being
treated for depression.

147
00:08:18,080 --> 00:08:19,520
Even if they performed an autopsy,

148
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:21,200
no one would be surprised.

149
00:08:22,920 --> 00:08:25,040
If they found sedatives in his system,

150
00:08:25,680 --> 00:08:28,680
there was no way
they could trace it back to me.

151
00:08:48,760 --> 00:08:51,720
He was just a sleepyhead
who liked to nap in his car.

152
00:08:52,680 --> 00:08:53,880
No one would ever suspect

153
00:08:53,920 --> 00:08:56,160
that someone had deliberately drugged him

154
00:08:56,320 --> 00:08:58,200
and left him to suffocate.

155
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:15,000
Sir.

156
00:09:15,760 --> 00:09:17,360
Why are you sleeping in the car?

157
00:09:17,960 --> 00:09:19,040
Chok.

158
00:09:20,040 --> 00:09:21,120
Handle it.

159
00:09:27,880 --> 00:09:28,920
Come here.

160
00:09:29,320 --> 00:09:30,200
Hush money.

161
00:09:30,480 --> 00:09:32,000
If you don't want any trouble,

162
00:09:32,680 --> 00:09:33,880
keep your mouth shut.

163
00:09:38,480 --> 00:09:40,320
That security guard is already dead.

164
00:09:46,440 --> 00:09:47,920
In exchange for a small amount of money.

165
00:09:49,920 --> 00:09:51,120
And now...

166
00:09:52,040 --> 00:09:53,240
it's your turn.

167
00:09:55,560 --> 00:09:58,720
So Itti was the one
who set up Anda's car system,

168
00:09:58,720 --> 00:10:00,160
making it so the car wouldn't open.

169
00:10:00,200 --> 00:10:01,320
With just that app,

170
00:10:01,360 --> 00:10:02,760
he could trap someone inside the car

171
00:10:02,800 --> 00:10:04,560
and let them suffocate to death.

172
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:07,240
What a f*cking monster.

173
00:10:07,480 --> 00:10:09,120
That's his own brother.

174
00:10:13,160 --> 00:10:15,320
Where is all my data?

175
00:10:16,240 --> 00:10:17,480
I'm going to destroy it all.

176
00:10:24,240 --> 00:10:25,080
Mr. Jin.

177
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:26,480
You might be the son of the owner,

178
00:10:26,480 --> 00:10:29,120
but the residents could report
you for doing this.

179
00:10:29,520 --> 00:10:30,320
Mr. Jin.

180
00:10:30,360 --> 00:10:32,640
I think we should wait for
the tenant to return.

181
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:34,360
You should help me find something instead.

182
00:10:35,120 --> 00:10:36,560
What are you looking for, Mr. Jin?

183
00:10:37,280 --> 00:10:40,040
Anything that can store data.

184
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:41,520
Do you guys know anything else?

185
00:10:41,600 --> 00:10:43,360
Explain everything to me.

186
00:10:43,400 --> 00:10:44,960
I only know as much as you guys do.

187
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:47,480
Jin just told us to be on standby.

188
00:10:47,800 --> 00:10:50,920
He's trying to find out where Itti is.

189
00:10:51,480 --> 00:10:52,760
Why go find Itti?

190
00:10:53,040 --> 00:10:54,000
Wait a minute.

191
00:10:54,520 --> 00:10:55,840
Don't tell me

192
00:10:56,160 --> 00:10:58,400
that's why we can't reach Podduang.

193
00:11:00,520 --> 00:11:02,080
I'm going to count to three.

194
00:11:03,760 --> 00:11:04,560
Please,

195
00:11:04,680 --> 00:11:07,360
I... I didn't keep anything.

196
00:11:07,480 --> 00:11:08,800
I really deleted it all.

197
00:11:08,800 --> 00:11:09,480
One.

198
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:11,040
She said she deleted it!

199
00:11:11,080 --> 00:11:11,640
Two.

200
00:11:11,680 --> 00:11:14,040
You can check my computer or my phone.

201
00:11:14,080 --> 00:11:15,040
I don't believe you.

202
00:11:19,840 --> 00:11:21,280
This might be a bit old,

203
00:11:21,360 --> 00:11:23,680
but I think it can store data.

204
00:11:31,480 --> 00:11:33,040
Where is that damn flash drive?

205
00:11:34,520 --> 00:11:36,440
Otherwise, I'll blow this kid's head off.

206
00:11:40,240 --> 00:11:41,040
Quick!

207
00:11:47,680 --> 00:11:48,840
I knew

208
00:11:49,480 --> 00:11:51,800
you might not believe me if I just told you.

209
00:11:52,360 --> 00:11:54,120
So I brought the evidence

210
00:11:55,000 --> 00:11:56,400
I just found.

211
00:12:01,640 --> 00:12:03,240
If I hadn't seen this evidence,

212
00:12:03,280 --> 00:12:04,720
I would never have believed

213
00:12:04,840 --> 00:12:08,440
that my eldest son,
whom I love and am so proud of,

214
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:12,240
was capable of doing such terrible things.

215
00:12:13,360 --> 00:12:16,320
I think Itti might have abducted Podduang.

216
00:12:18,400 --> 00:12:19,440
What do you mean?

217
00:12:19,440 --> 00:12:21,840
And what does Podduang
have to do with it?

218
00:12:24,800 --> 00:12:26,160
Hurry and go help Podduang.

219
00:12:27,320 --> 00:12:28,600
Anda...

220
00:12:29,240 --> 00:12:30,360
He told me

221
00:12:30,920 --> 00:12:32,240
to hurry and go help Podduang.

222
00:12:33,240 --> 00:12:34,560
Do you

223
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:36,280
have any idea

224
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:39,360
where Itti might have taken Podduang?

225
00:12:42,160 --> 00:12:43,480
You probably don't know

226
00:12:43,800 --> 00:12:46,320
who that condo belongs to.

227
00:12:49,400 --> 00:12:50,960
I don't care who it belongs to.

228
00:12:52,200 --> 00:12:53,480
Where did you hide the drive?

229
00:12:53,840 --> 00:12:55,920
Otherwise, I'll beat you to death.

230
00:12:56,320 --> 00:12:57,320
Amp.

231
00:12:58,000 --> 00:12:59,640
I tried to track the signal from the earbuds.

232
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:01,720
Before it disappeared,

233
00:13:02,040 --> 00:13:03,480
it was in this area.

234
00:13:11,360 --> 00:13:13,920
Or could it be the building
that I gave to Itti?

235
00:13:35,520 --> 00:13:36,600
Are you going to tell me or not?

236
00:13:36,960 --> 00:13:40,920
[Thamprateep]

237
00:13:41,080 --> 00:13:42,240
Just tell him, Amp.

238
00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:45,000
It's okay.

239
00:13:48,040 --> 00:13:51,360
You're only good
at using violence to put up a front,

240
00:13:51,720 --> 00:13:54,280
but deep down, you're scared shitless.

241
00:13:56,080 --> 00:13:57,680
How pathetic!

242
00:13:57,720 --> 00:13:58,280
You...

243
00:13:59,600 --> 00:14:00,800
No one would care

244
00:14:01,200 --> 00:14:02,800
if someone like you died.

245
00:14:03,720 --> 00:14:05,040
Why the hell are you butting in?

246
00:14:05,160 --> 00:14:06,600
No matter how many people you kill,

247
00:14:06,800 --> 00:14:09,120
- your life will never get better.
- So what?

248
00:14:11,680 --> 00:14:13,120
The one who's supposed to die tonight

249
00:14:14,240 --> 00:14:15,240
isn't me.

250
00:14:15,800 --> 00:14:17,360
It's you.

251
00:14:18,520 --> 00:14:20,080
This is what you want, right?

252
00:14:23,600 --> 00:14:25,040
- Jin!
- You, stay back!

253
00:14:31,720 --> 00:14:33,160
Where else did you copy it?

254
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:35,800
Good question.

255
00:14:35,960 --> 00:14:37,200
Don't be a smartass with me.

256
00:14:38,080 --> 00:14:40,360
You know one shot will blow
your brains out, right?

257
00:14:41,520 --> 00:14:42,600
You don't even know

258
00:14:43,160 --> 00:14:44,960
where else I've backed it up.

259
00:14:45,920 --> 00:14:47,240
You'll never know

260
00:14:48,040 --> 00:14:49,800
who else knows what you've done.

261
00:14:51,200 --> 00:14:53,000
You'll have to live
in constant fear,

262
00:14:54,280 --> 00:14:56,480
hunting down everyone
who knows your secret.

263
00:14:57,400 --> 00:14:59,000
Whatever I do is my business.

264
00:15:00,760 --> 00:15:01,720
Really?

265
00:15:03,640 --> 00:15:06,240
Are you really going to
hunt down everyone who knows?

266
00:15:12,600 --> 00:15:13,480
Dad...

267
00:15:15,240 --> 00:15:16,480
Dad, what are you doing here?

268
00:15:18,160 --> 00:15:20,280
I should be the one asking you that.

269
00:15:21,200 --> 00:15:23,160
What are you doing here?

270
00:15:28,240 --> 00:15:31,080
Did you really kill your brother, Itti?

271
00:15:33,640 --> 00:15:34,840
You did that

272
00:15:34,920 --> 00:15:37,240
just because you wanted to be successful?

273
00:15:37,800 --> 00:15:38,800
Is that all?

274
00:15:41,240 --> 00:15:44,440
You wanted to make me
and everyone proud of you,

275
00:15:45,840 --> 00:15:47,240
so you had to do that?

276
00:15:48,320 --> 00:15:50,160
If so, why don't you just kill me, too?

277
00:15:50,200 --> 00:15:51,000
Dad...

278
00:15:51,800 --> 00:15:53,320
don't say such things.

279
00:15:54,640 --> 00:15:56,800
Everything I did was for our family.

280
00:15:56,840 --> 00:15:59,360
Even if you had to kill your family?

281
00:16:00,600 --> 00:16:01,280
Look...

282
00:16:02,640 --> 00:16:03,760
You've lost your mind.

283
00:16:03,800 --> 00:16:05,120
You've gone completely insane, Itti.

284
00:16:05,440 --> 00:16:07,360
I never taught you
to be this kind of person.

285
00:16:07,400 --> 00:16:08,520
I never raised you like this.

286
00:16:08,560 --> 00:16:09,840
Wasn't it because of you?

287
00:16:11,080 --> 00:16:13,000
You were always pressuring me to be
the person you wanted me to be.

288
00:16:14,760 --> 00:16:16,720
You let Anda live his own life,

289
00:16:17,800 --> 00:16:20,640
but I had to be everything you said.

290
00:16:21,400 --> 00:16:22,480
This is it, Dad.

291
00:16:23,280 --> 00:16:25,040
I'm proving to you

292
00:16:25,680 --> 00:16:27,840
that I can be the good son you want.

293
00:16:30,200 --> 00:16:31,040
You...

294
00:16:34,040 --> 00:16:35,640
Where else did you copy this?

295
00:16:49,720 --> 00:16:50,600
Listen.

296
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:53,840
What the hell
are you making me listen to now?

297
00:16:55,760 --> 00:16:56,720
Just listen.

298
00:17:18,319 --> 00:17:20,040
- I don't hear a damn...
- Itti.

299
00:17:29,200 --> 00:17:30,360
I'm right here.

300
00:17:30,920 --> 00:17:32,040
Right next to you.

301
00:17:35,920 --> 00:17:37,440
Is this a joke?

302
00:17:37,960 --> 00:17:39,640
Where did you get Anda's voice from?

303
00:17:39,800 --> 00:17:41,680
I know you wanted to be successful.

304
00:17:42,080 --> 00:17:43,360
I know you felt pressured.

305
00:17:44,120 --> 00:17:46,040
But did you have to do this to me?

306
00:17:46,400 --> 00:17:48,000
I'm your own brother.

307
00:17:49,720 --> 00:17:51,360
Did you hate me that much?

308
00:17:51,560 --> 00:17:52,640
How could you do it?

309
00:17:52,680 --> 00:17:53,720
Who the hell are you?

310
00:17:53,880 --> 00:17:54,920
Shut the hell up!

311
00:17:55,960 --> 00:17:59,000
Don't you remember how close we were?

312
00:18:00,800 --> 00:18:03,040
You used to sneak me out of school
and go to the beach.

313
00:18:03,440 --> 00:18:04,920
Don't you remember?

314
00:18:08,560 --> 00:18:09,560
Anda...

315
00:18:11,040 --> 00:18:12,080
Anda?

316
00:18:26,480 --> 00:18:27,960
Is it really you, Anda?

317
00:18:30,600 --> 00:18:32,240
I'm sorry for making
things hard for you.

318
00:18:34,000 --> 00:18:36,000
If I had asked whether you were tired

319
00:18:36,600 --> 00:18:38,080
of the burden you were carrying

320
00:18:39,360 --> 00:18:41,240
or whether you wanted my help...

321
00:18:42,000 --> 00:18:43,720
If only we had talked before,

322
00:18:45,160 --> 00:18:46,800
you might not have hated me this much.

323
00:18:49,240 --> 00:18:50,320
I...

324
00:18:51,320 --> 00:18:52,920
You've been so tired, haven't you?

325
00:18:53,920 --> 00:18:55,040
All this time.

326
00:19:16,000 --> 00:19:17,800
How can I fix this?

327
00:19:18,880 --> 00:19:20,080
You can't.

328
00:19:20,640 --> 00:19:22,880
Just let everything be as it should be.

329
00:19:23,680 --> 00:19:25,760
You can't control everything in this world.

330
00:19:27,480 --> 00:19:30,000
But I didn't mean for it
to turn out like this.

331
00:19:31,160 --> 00:19:32,960
I didn't want this either.

332
00:19:33,560 --> 00:19:35,360
Let this end now, Itti.

333
00:19:36,280 --> 00:19:38,160
Spend the rest of your life
reflecting on what you've done.

334
00:19:40,480 --> 00:19:43,040
Mom and Dad are ready
to give you a chance.

335
00:19:43,880 --> 00:19:45,920
Mom and Dad love you very much.

336
00:19:46,880 --> 00:19:49,360
- They really love you so much.
- Anda...

337
00:19:50,520 --> 00:19:51,920
I'm sorry.

338
00:19:54,000 --> 00:19:55,760
I'm sorry, Anda.

339
00:20:00,800 --> 00:20:03,360
I didn't mean for this to happen.

340
00:20:03,600 --> 00:20:04,800
I'm sorry.

341
00:20:08,640 --> 00:20:09,880
I'm sorry.

342
00:20:10,640 --> 00:20:11,480
I'm really sorry.

343
00:20:11,520 --> 00:20:12,360
Itti.

344
00:20:14,800 --> 00:20:16,680
Anda, I'm sorry.

345
00:20:17,640 --> 00:20:20,680
I didn't mean it. I'm sorry.

346
00:20:25,960 --> 00:20:26,960
Anda...

347
00:20:28,000 --> 00:20:28,880
I'm sorry.

348
00:20:30,160 --> 00:20:31,200
Anda...

349
00:20:32,320 --> 00:20:33,280
I'm really sorry.

350
00:20:42,920 --> 00:20:43,840
This way, please.

351
00:20:53,920 --> 00:20:55,360
Ma'am, please step to the side.

352
00:20:57,000 --> 00:20:57,960
Podduang.

353
00:20:58,160 --> 00:21:00,000
Are you really skipping the hospital?

354
00:21:01,080 --> 00:21:02,160
I'll go in a bit.

355
00:21:02,880 --> 00:21:04,160
I want to settle things here first.

356
00:21:04,480 --> 00:21:06,680
Yeah, go get yourself checked out.

357
00:21:07,560 --> 00:21:09,720
We'll take Anda's dad
to the police station.

358
00:21:19,240 --> 00:21:22,560
We'll ride with the police
to give our statements.

359
00:21:23,480 --> 00:21:25,280
You guys drive safely, okay?

360
00:21:34,080 --> 00:21:35,240
Does it hurt?

361
00:21:37,600 --> 00:21:38,600
Only a little.

362
00:21:50,160 --> 00:21:51,680
Promise me, Podduang.

363
00:21:52,240 --> 00:21:53,720
Don't ever do this again.

364
00:21:58,000 --> 00:21:58,840
Okay.

365
00:22:01,720 --> 00:22:03,360
Don't ever disappear like that again.

366
00:22:22,480 --> 00:22:23,960
- Can we get an interview?
- Can we have an interview, please?

367
00:22:24,000 --> 00:22:25,600
- Please answer us.
- Do you regret what you did?

368
00:22:25,640 --> 00:22:26,560
- Can you speak to the camera?
- Make way, please.

369
00:22:26,560 --> 00:22:28,320
- Out of the way!
- How does it feel to murder your own brother?

370
00:22:28,320 --> 00:22:30,160
Do you think you'll get away with this?

371
00:22:30,160 --> 00:22:32,120
- Do you think your rank
- Why did you have to go that far?

372
00:22:32,120 --> 00:22:33,920
- will save you?
- That's right.

373
00:22:33,960 --> 00:22:35,000
Please answer the question.

374
00:22:35,040 --> 00:22:36,080
Please make way.

375
00:22:36,080 --> 00:22:37,080
- Answer us, please.
- Sir!

376
00:22:37,080 --> 00:22:38,960
- Out of the way, please!
- Please answer the questions.

377
00:22:39,000 --> 00:22:39,920
Why did you do this?

378
00:22:39,960 --> 00:22:41,560
- Please give us an answer.
- Sir!

379
00:22:41,600 --> 00:22:43,360
- Excuse me.
- Move aside, please.

380
00:22:43,400 --> 00:22:44,600
What does your family have to say?

381
00:22:44,600 --> 00:22:47,040
- Mr. Itti, answer our questions.
- Answer the questions!

382
00:22:47,080 --> 00:22:48,400
Can you tell us why you killed him?

383
00:22:48,440 --> 00:22:49,920
What did your brother do to you?

384
00:22:53,440 --> 00:22:54,080
Yes, exactly.

385
00:22:54,120 --> 00:22:55,200
Please answer the question.

386
00:22:55,200 --> 00:22:56,240
Please make way.

387
00:22:56,280 --> 00:22:57,240
- Answer us, please.
- Sir!

388
00:22:57,240 --> 00:22:57,840
Out of the way, please!

389
00:22:57,880 --> 00:22:58,960
That's enough.

390
00:22:59,720 --> 00:23:01,560
You look so stressed, do you realize?

391
00:23:01,960 --> 00:23:02,920
You'll get wrinkles early.

392
00:23:03,560 --> 00:23:06,440
Just look at the news.
How could I not be stressed?

393
00:23:12,600 --> 00:23:14,400
I dreamed about Anda last night.

394
00:23:15,000 --> 00:23:16,240
Just like the night before.

395
00:23:19,080 --> 00:23:21,080
Anda probably wanted to thank us.

396
00:23:22,360 --> 00:23:25,160
I hope Anda's spirit won't
have to suffer anymore.

397
00:23:39,280 --> 00:23:40,960
Will Anda be okay?

398
00:23:43,560 --> 00:23:45,800
Is he still holding on to something?

399
00:23:47,040 --> 00:23:48,040
I don't know.

400
00:23:49,480 --> 00:23:52,280
But not hearing the voices
from the earbuds anymore might mean...

401
00:23:54,760 --> 00:23:56,600
he's in a better place now.

402
00:24:07,880 --> 00:24:09,960
We've done all we could, Jin.

403
00:24:13,640 --> 00:24:15,880
You were the best friend
Anda could have asked for.

404
00:24:17,200 --> 00:24:19,080
I'm sure Anda can feel it.

405
00:24:21,280 --> 00:24:22,800
You and all our friends

406
00:24:24,280 --> 00:24:25,920
gave it your all for Anda.

407
00:24:57,040 --> 00:24:58,240
Hello.

408
00:24:59,400 --> 00:25:00,640
I'm Jinna,

409
00:25:01,480 --> 00:25:02,720
Anda's friend.

410
00:25:04,680 --> 00:25:06,080
Anda and I

411
00:25:07,440 --> 00:25:09,000
were very close.

412
00:25:10,840 --> 00:25:12,320
But I know that

413
00:25:13,720 --> 00:25:15,080
it wasn't as long as his family,

414
00:25:16,400 --> 00:25:18,280
who had been with him
since the day he was born.

415
00:25:28,320 --> 00:25:30,080
The ones who shaped him
into who he was,

416
00:25:31,440 --> 00:25:33,200
into our beloved Anda.

417
00:25:38,720 --> 00:25:40,080
We all know that

418
00:25:41,360 --> 00:25:42,840
he was lovely

419
00:25:43,560 --> 00:25:44,800
and kind-hearted.

420
00:25:45,320 --> 00:25:49,000
- Andaman! Andaman!
- Andaman! Andaman!

421
00:25:53,080 --> 00:25:56,480
He was someone who always had
a smile for everyone.

422
00:25:57,440 --> 00:26:00,760
- Please look forward to it.
- Andaman!

423
00:26:00,760 --> 00:26:02,000
- Andaman!
- Andaman!

424
00:26:06,040 --> 00:26:08,360
He's someone we've always loved.

425
00:26:09,840 --> 00:26:12,560
In a bridge rectifier circuit, four diodes are

426
00:26:12,560 --> 00:26:13,800
connected in a diamond shape...

427
00:26:13,800 --> 00:26:14,440
Yes.

428
00:26:14,880 --> 00:26:17,560
It's a closed electrical circuit.

429
00:26:18,000 --> 00:26:20,720
No matter what happened in his life,

430
00:26:22,160 --> 00:26:24,240
none of us wanted him to be in pain,

431
00:26:24,880 --> 00:26:26,280
even for a moment.

432
00:26:31,320 --> 00:26:34,720
How do you guys think
the four of us will be when we grow up?

433
00:26:35,480 --> 00:26:37,320
You're talking like

434
00:26:37,840 --> 00:26:39,480
we're so young right now.

435
00:26:41,200 --> 00:26:42,400
We are still very young

436
00:26:42,640 --> 00:26:44,560
compared to the average human lifespan.

437
00:26:45,120 --> 00:26:47,120
We've only lived
a quarter of our lives.

438
00:26:49,240 --> 00:26:50,440
Who knows

439
00:26:51,400 --> 00:26:53,280
how long we'll live?

440
00:26:54,800 --> 00:26:56,200
Maybe we've already lived half our lives.

441
00:26:56,520 --> 00:26:57,240
Hey.

442
00:26:58,080 --> 00:26:59,920
Why do you always assume the worst?

443
00:27:00,600 --> 00:27:01,880
Let me tell you something.

444
00:27:02,160 --> 00:27:04,560
A good person like you will live a long time.

445
00:27:04,800 --> 00:27:06,920
Hey, but I'm not staying until I'm old.

446
00:27:06,960 --> 00:27:07,760
I can't be bothered.

447
00:27:09,320 --> 00:27:10,640
I don't know

448
00:27:10,760 --> 00:27:12,600
how much time we have left.

449
00:27:13,760 --> 00:27:15,320
But as long as I'm alive,

450
00:27:16,400 --> 00:27:18,840
I want to make every second count

451
00:27:20,400 --> 00:27:21,600
with the people I love,

452
00:27:23,040 --> 00:27:24,280
doing what I want to do.

453
00:27:25,800 --> 00:27:27,240
Look at that sunset.

454
00:27:28,680 --> 00:27:29,760
It's so beautiful.

455
00:27:30,080 --> 00:27:31,840
I don't even know
if we'll get to see this after we're gone.

456
00:27:33,640 --> 00:27:36,080
And I hope I'll be
with you guys for a long time.

457
00:27:37,040 --> 00:27:38,240
Don't you dare leave me.

458
00:27:39,440 --> 00:27:41,280
- Come on.
- Who would ever leave you, man?

459
00:27:43,360 --> 00:27:44,960
Hey, guys.

460
00:27:45,720 --> 00:27:48,800
- Friends forever.
- Friends forever.

461
00:27:53,760 --> 00:27:55,880
We all saw him as a wonderful friend.

462
00:27:57,280 --> 00:27:59,320
We shared many good times together.

463
00:28:01,400 --> 00:28:02,720
I could feel that

464
00:28:03,800 --> 00:28:05,600
Anda was very happy

465
00:28:07,320 --> 00:28:09,200
to be surrounded by the love

466
00:28:11,560 --> 00:28:13,440
and well-wishes of his friends.

467
00:28:16,040 --> 00:28:18,000
I hoped he'd meet someone good

468
00:28:20,200 --> 00:28:21,800
who would love him with all their heart.

469
00:28:22,760 --> 00:28:24,560
And Anda was so incredibly lucky

470
00:28:24,960 --> 00:28:26,560
to have found that person

471
00:28:28,080 --> 00:28:30,360
while he was still alive.

472
00:28:32,280 --> 00:28:34,440
Even though it wasn't for very long,

473
00:28:35,880 --> 00:28:37,080
I believe

474
00:28:38,560 --> 00:28:40,960
that relationship was
truly precious to him.

475
00:28:45,840 --> 00:28:47,640
He met a man who loved him

476
00:28:49,800 --> 00:28:52,240
and wished him well unconditionally.

477
00:28:54,800 --> 00:28:55,760
Anda...

478
00:28:59,040 --> 00:29:00,040
I don't know

479
00:29:00,440 --> 00:29:01,840
where you are right now.

480
00:29:03,560 --> 00:29:04,840
But all of us

481
00:29:05,960 --> 00:29:07,560
hope that you're doing well.

482
00:29:11,040 --> 00:29:13,240
You don't have to suffer anymore.

483
00:29:16,240 --> 00:29:18,560
This world never deserved
a good person like you.

484
00:29:20,280 --> 00:29:21,840
I love you so much, Anda.

485
00:29:23,560 --> 00:29:25,360
We all truly love you.

486
00:29:27,200 --> 00:29:28,600
I still stand by my word.

487
00:29:29,960 --> 00:29:31,560
I will never leave you.

488
00:29:33,360 --> 00:29:35,360
You will always be in my heart,

489
00:29:35,800 --> 00:29:37,560
and in all of our friends' hearts, too.

490
00:29:40,240 --> 00:29:41,760
I'm always with you,

491
00:29:42,640 --> 00:29:43,640
Anda.

492
00:29:44,920 --> 00:29:51,480
♫Whenever I think about our memories,
I still smile at what used to be♫

493
00:29:52,280 --> 00:29:59,200
♫Through the days, months, and years,
all the good times we shared♫

494
00:29:59,680 --> 00:30:06,680
♫If I could go back to those days,
I'd do it all the same way♫

495
00:30:07,040 --> 00:30:13,880
♫I'd do everything I could
just to meet with you♫

496
00:30:14,280 --> 00:30:23,040
♫Thank you for coming into my life,
thank you for making this love feel right♫

497
00:30:23,080 --> 00:30:31,200
♫My heart is filled with bliss
when we're holding hands like this♫

498
00:30:31,240 --> 00:30:37,840
♫With you, every single second
of mine is meaningful♫

499
00:30:37,880 --> 00:30:44,120
♫Every story and night we spent together♫

500
00:30:44,160 --> 00:30:49,040
♫Will be precious to me forever♫

501
00:30:54,680 --> 00:30:57,520
I know it's hard to believe.

502
00:30:58,160 --> 00:31:01,840
But I figured this out by listening
to the sounds in these earbuds.

503
00:31:02,040 --> 00:31:04,720
If I have to give a statement,
this is exactly what I'd say.

504
00:31:05,600 --> 00:31:06,880
I want to believe you.

505
00:31:07,040 --> 00:31:09,200
But isn't it a bit far-fetched?

506
00:31:09,920 --> 00:31:13,120
You're telling me your late friend

507
00:31:13,440 --> 00:31:15,920
talked to you through earbuds?

508
00:31:19,880 --> 00:31:21,840
How am I supposed to write a report about this?

509
00:31:23,280 --> 00:31:24,840
I understand that it's difficult.

510
00:31:25,200 --> 00:31:28,200
Tell you what, after the cremation,
I'll help you out.

511
00:31:28,960 --> 00:31:31,840
I can phrase it so it works
for official documents. I get it.

512
00:31:32,880 --> 00:31:34,840
Hmm, okay. Alright.

513
00:31:35,840 --> 00:31:37,440
You've done a great job.

514
00:31:37,720 --> 00:31:38,680
Thank you.

515
00:31:39,040 --> 00:31:42,240
But if I may give some advice,
don't ever do what you did again.

516
00:31:42,560 --> 00:31:44,320
Okay? It's dangerous.

517
00:31:44,920 --> 00:31:48,200
I wouldn't do anything like this again.

518
00:31:51,560 --> 00:31:52,960
My condolences once again.

519
00:31:53,960 --> 00:31:54,960
Thank you.

520
00:32:17,720 --> 00:32:18,800
Wake up.

521
00:32:19,400 --> 00:32:20,800
- Art.
- What?

522
00:32:20,960 --> 00:32:22,320
Anda came to me in a dream.

523
00:32:22,480 --> 00:32:23,200
And?

524
00:32:23,440 --> 00:32:24,560
He said I'm going to win the lottery.

525
00:32:25,000 --> 00:32:26,920
No way, are you for real?

526
00:32:26,960 --> 00:32:30,040
- Not kidding, man. It's real.
- Wow!

527
00:32:30,040 --> 00:32:31,800
What are we eating tonight?

528
00:32:32,000 --> 00:32:34,000
Let's go for some raw beef salad, buddy.

529
00:32:34,000 --> 00:32:35,720
- And some soi ju, too.
- You got it.

530
00:32:35,760 --> 00:32:38,160
Let's do it!

531
00:32:52,600 --> 00:32:54,640
Why did you let yourself go like this?

532
00:32:56,040 --> 00:32:57,640
I don't think you're sad.

533
00:32:58,960 --> 00:33:00,760
I think you're just being lazy.

534
00:33:04,080 --> 00:33:05,120
What about Jin?

535
00:33:05,920 --> 00:33:07,960
Why did he disappear after the funeral?

536
00:33:09,040 --> 00:33:10,080
Don't tell me...

537
00:33:11,160 --> 00:33:12,600
that you've been dumped already.

538
00:33:13,280 --> 00:33:16,480
Satang, stop annoying me.
I'm trying to watch a movie.

539
00:33:16,720 --> 00:33:18,440
Did that strike a nerve?

540
00:33:19,240 --> 00:33:20,360
Did you really get dumped?

541
00:33:21,200 --> 00:33:22,600
Just get lost already!

542
00:33:23,600 --> 00:33:25,000
Well, it makes sense.

543
00:33:25,680 --> 00:33:27,200
He's the son of a billionaire.

544
00:33:27,840 --> 00:33:30,600
Why would he date
a dim-witted college kid like you?

545
00:33:30,960 --> 00:33:32,680
I told you to get lost!

546
00:33:33,080 --> 00:33:34,600
Yeah, I'm leaving now.

547
00:33:35,040 --> 00:33:37,200
Watching a soccer game with friends.
I'm not coming back tonight.

548
00:33:49,520 --> 00:33:51,800
[Podduang: How are you?]

549
00:33:51,840 --> 00:33:54,040
[Jinna: Still at the event with my dad.]

550
00:33:54,080 --> 00:33:56,280
[Podduang: I've finished several
movies already.]

551
00:33:56,320 --> 00:33:58,640
[It's so boring.
Satang isn't home, either.]

552
00:34:14,600 --> 00:34:16,159
Say hello to Lady Pat, son.

553
00:34:16,480 --> 00:34:17,360
Hello.

554
00:34:18,000 --> 00:34:19,520
Whoa, Jin.

555
00:34:19,679 --> 00:34:21,440
You've grown up so much.

556
00:34:21,560 --> 00:34:24,760
You rarely attend events with your dad.
I've been wanting to see you.

557
00:34:25,840 --> 00:34:27,199
He's a bit shy.

558
00:34:27,320 --> 00:34:30,520
But we've agreed now that he'll be
taking over the business from me.

559
00:34:30,920 --> 00:34:33,679
So I have to take him out to socialize,
or people might completely forget him.

560
00:34:33,800 --> 00:34:36,760
Oh, how could anyone forget him?
He's so handsome.

561
00:34:37,320 --> 00:34:40,520
Do you have a girlfriend?
Want me to introduce you to someone?

562
00:34:43,360 --> 00:34:45,120
What kind of girls do you like?

563
00:34:47,080 --> 00:34:48,560
Let's leave that for later.

564
00:34:48,560 --> 00:34:50,280
I want to teach him the ropes first.

565
00:34:50,320 --> 00:34:51,280
That's right.

566
00:34:51,400 --> 00:34:53,239
How can you say that, Mr. Chanin?

567
00:34:53,360 --> 00:34:55,199
He should be doing both at the same time.

568
00:34:56,000 --> 00:34:58,280
He's still a fine young man, isn't he?

569
00:35:14,160 --> 00:35:15,960
Oh, Amp.

570
00:35:16,840 --> 00:35:18,280
I knew you weren't asleep yet.

571
00:35:18,280 --> 00:35:21,080
I bought some apples for you.
Here, plenty of them.

572
00:35:26,360 --> 00:35:27,640
You brought so many.

573
00:35:28,680 --> 00:35:29,920
How am I going to eat all these alone?

574
00:35:30,120 --> 00:35:32,520
Well, eat them with Jin then.

575
00:35:37,120 --> 00:35:38,680
Why are you making that face?

576
00:35:38,880 --> 00:35:39,880
Did you two have a fight?

577
00:35:43,120 --> 00:35:45,480
If there's something wrong,
just talk it out and settle it.

578
00:35:45,520 --> 00:35:46,520
Okay?

579
00:35:48,600 --> 00:35:49,560
I'll go now.

580
00:36:27,960 --> 00:36:29,160
Have you been drinking?

581
00:36:29,280 --> 00:36:30,120
Mm.

582
00:36:30,760 --> 00:36:32,640
Everyone kept trying to get me to drink.

583
00:36:34,200 --> 00:36:35,840
I missed you like crazy.

584
00:36:38,880 --> 00:36:40,760
And... you look so handsome.

585
00:36:43,600 --> 00:36:44,840
I can be even more handsome than this.

586
00:36:53,840 --> 00:36:55,320
Satang isn't coming back tonight, right?

587
00:36:59,080 --> 00:37:00,000
Yeah.

588
00:37:02,520 --> 00:37:03,760
♫Is missing you what love feels like?♫

589
00:37:03,800 --> 00:37:05,080
♫You're always on my mind,♫

590
00:37:05,080 --> 00:37:07,560
♫Whatever I do,
I think of you all day and night,♫

591
00:37:07,600 --> 00:37:10,040
♫I guess this is what love feels like♫

592
00:37:10,080 --> 00:37:11,400
♫Will it break my heart if I say it tonight?♫

593
00:37:11,440 --> 00:37:12,680
♫But I can't keep it inside♫

594
00:37:12,720 --> 00:37:15,160
♫I thought I was just lonely, nothing more,♫

595
00:37:15,200 --> 00:37:17,720
♫Then you came so casually,
like you'd done it before,♫

596
00:37:17,720 --> 00:37:20,320
♫You're simply being yourself,
yet somehow I fall,♫

597
00:37:20,360 --> 00:37:23,280
♫So, wanna give it a try and be my all?♫

598
00:37:24,160 --> 00:37:29,240
♫I was caught off guard, I don't know what to do♫

599
00:37:29,240 --> 00:37:34,560
♫So let me just tell you how much I love you♫

600
00:40:41,480 --> 00:40:42,280
Jin.

601
00:40:43,200 --> 00:40:44,000
Yes?

602
00:40:45,280 --> 00:40:46,520
How much do you love me?

603
00:40:48,560 --> 00:40:49,760
Why are you asking?

604
00:40:53,240 --> 00:40:54,480
Do you love me?

605
00:40:55,720 --> 00:40:58,160
I don't have a big reveal about
being a billionaire's son like you do.

606
00:40:58,880 --> 00:41:00,040
Are you crazy?

607
00:41:00,520 --> 00:41:01,640
What are you thinking?

608
00:41:03,080 --> 00:41:03,880
I...

609
00:41:05,360 --> 00:41:06,880
I'm just a dim-witted college kid,

610
00:41:07,560 --> 00:41:09,160
like Satang said.

611
00:41:10,680 --> 00:41:11,920
Will you get bored of me?

612
00:41:13,200 --> 00:41:14,560
You're filthy rich,

613
00:41:16,160 --> 00:41:17,560
while I have nothing.

614
00:41:20,480 --> 00:41:21,760
Why would you need to be rich?

615
00:41:23,720 --> 00:41:25,160
I can support you
for the rest of your life.

616
00:41:25,520 --> 00:41:26,480
It's no big deal.

617
00:41:27,440 --> 00:41:28,320
I don't know.

618
00:41:30,120 --> 00:41:31,200
Just don't ever get bored of me.

619
00:41:33,040 --> 00:41:34,640
I love you so much, Jin.

620
00:41:42,440 --> 00:41:43,680
I won't.

621
00:41:44,840 --> 00:41:46,560
I love you so much, too.

622
00:41:48,560 --> 00:41:50,000
Don't overthink it.

623
00:41:55,280 --> 00:41:56,600
I'll be right here,

624
00:41:58,360 --> 00:41:59,840
loving you more and more,

625
00:42:00,480 --> 00:42:01,920
every single day.

626
00:42:02,760 --> 00:42:04,280
I love you before I go to sleep,

627
00:42:05,200 --> 00:42:07,080
and I love you when I wake up.

628
00:42:07,760 --> 00:42:09,160
I'll never stop loving you.

629
00:42:09,960 --> 00:42:11,720
Even if you get bored, I won't care.

630
00:42:12,680 --> 00:42:13,640
Understand?

631
00:42:17,840 --> 00:42:19,440
I love you this much already.

632
00:42:21,360 --> 00:42:22,880
Don't overthink it anymore.

633
00:42:27,920 --> 00:42:29,600
Thank you so much, Jin.

634
00:42:31,720 --> 00:42:33,600
Thank you for coming into my life.

635
00:42:35,120 --> 00:42:36,680
Thank you for everything.

636
00:42:37,960 --> 00:42:39,360
I love you so much.

637
00:42:44,520 --> 00:42:46,240
I love you so much more.

638
00:43:09,000 --> 00:43:10,600
Hello, everyone.

639
00:43:10,800 --> 00:43:13,080
Welcome to the Sports Friendship Event

640
00:43:13,080 --> 00:43:15,120
between the Faculty of Engineering
and Sports Science.

641
00:43:15,160 --> 00:43:17,800
Let me hear some noise for
the faculty you're cheering for!

642
00:43:21,280 --> 00:43:22,960
Before we begin the competition,

643
00:43:22,960 --> 00:43:25,840
we have a small performance
for you all to enjoy.

644
00:43:25,880 --> 00:43:29,440
Representatives from both faculties
are here to cheer you on!

645
00:43:31,440 --> 00:43:32,560
Who are you screaming for?

646
00:43:32,600 --> 00:43:35,920
Don't tell me it's Art from Engineering.

647
00:43:36,320 --> 00:43:39,400
Ooh, or is it Dunk from Sports Science?

648
00:43:41,960 --> 00:43:43,760
Alright, keep that energy going!

649
00:43:43,800 --> 00:43:45,480
Now, let's get started.

650
00:44:08,800 --> 00:44:11,040
Why are you still sitting?
Get up, everyone!

651
00:44:19,320 --> 00:44:20,920
Our friends are freaking awesome.

652
00:44:21,360 --> 00:44:22,760
Bumm looks so cool!

653
00:44:25,440 --> 00:44:31,120
♫I used to wonder what we were,♫

654
00:44:32,000 --> 00:44:37,760
♫I thought love needed something clearer,♫

655
00:44:38,720 --> 00:44:43,960
♫Took me time to learn what really matters♫

656
00:44:45,600 --> 00:44:50,600
♫Love has no rules, whatever comes after♫

657
00:44:52,000 --> 00:44:57,400
♫As long as I know what my heart wants to find,♫

658
00:44:57,800 --> 00:45:00,360
♫As long as you're standing by my side,♫

659
00:45:00,360 --> 00:45:03,720
♫With you, the only one I'd choose every time,♫

660
00:45:03,760 --> 00:45:07,520
♫I don't need a reason, as long as you're mine♫

661
00:45:08,080 --> 00:45:10,600
♫As long as you hold my hand,♫

662
00:45:11,160 --> 00:45:13,680
♫As long as next to me is where you stand,♫

663
00:45:13,680 --> 00:45:17,040
♫You're the one I'll always try to understand,♫

664
00:45:17,080 --> 00:45:20,880
♫No matter how hard the road may be,♫

665
00:45:21,480 --> 00:45:23,960
♫Just hold my hand, and we'll be free♫

666
00:45:24,680 --> 00:45:27,440
♫As long as you're here with me♫

667
00:45:28,680 --> 00:45:34,240
♫I rest my hands, holding on to yours♫

668
00:45:35,360 --> 00:45:40,800
♫You chased away my uncertainty♫

